      <h3>4.1 Delivery Appointment Protocol</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>Once the freight reaches your local carrier distribution terminal, the freight carrier will contact you via phone or SMS to schedule a convenient <strong>delivery appointment window</strong>.</li>
        <li>The carrier delivers curbside with hydraulic liftgate equipment.</li>
        <li>Please perform an exterior inspection of the crate or carton before signing the delivery slip.</li>
      </ol>

      <h3>4.2 If You Are Unavailable</h3>
      <p>If you cannot be present for your scheduled appointment, the carrier will re-attempt delivery or hold the shipment at the regional terminal for up to 5 business days for customer pickup.</p>
